      <h1>Experience &amp; background</h1>
      <p class="lede">Investment research, macro strategy and equity sector coverage across buy-side and independent research roles.</p>

      <div class="cv-download">
        <div>
          <h3>Kevin Kamberi — Full CV</h3>
