  <section class="bordered">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:16px;">Experience</p>
      <ul class="timeline">
        <li>
          <div class="when">2022 — Present</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Independent Researcher</h4>
            <span class="org">Self-directed</span>
            <p>Publishing working-paper-format research on macro regimes, sector fundamentals and portfolio construction. Six publications to date across three coverage areas.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="when">2018 — 2022</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Macro &amp; Portfolio Strategy Analyst</h4>
            <span class="org">Asset management (buy side)</span>
            <p>Supported top-down asset allocation with liquidity, rates and cross-asset correlation research; built regime-based frameworks used in multi-asset portfolio construction.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="when">2014 — 2018</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Equity Research Associate</h4>
            <span class="org">Sell side — industrials &amp; technology coverage</span>
            <p>Covered capital goods and semiconductor supply-chain names; built cost-curve and capex-cycle models used across sector coverage.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

